    "text": "KIMT\nwebsite\nWinona County, Minnesota\nStormTrack 3: Midweek Flannel Alert, warming up into weekend\nBy Hunter Donahoe,\n16 hours ago(KIMT) -- Fall's latest chill has taken hold of SE Minnesota and North Iowa for your Wednesday morning. A Frost Advisory remains in place through 9 AM for Goodhue, Wabasha, Steele, Dodge, Olmsted, and Winona counties as temperatures remain near the freezing mark. Hopefully, you brought in those sensitive plants!\n5",
